      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks unsafe, and I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **Dose per administration:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times a day is 6400 mg/day. That's twice the usual prescription maximum of 3200 mg/day.\n\nAt this dose the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and other NSAID toxicity rises sharply, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Was one of these intended?**\n- **400 mg four times daily** (1600 mg/day total). If \"1600\" was meant as the daily total, this would be it.\n- **600 mg four times daily** (2400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg three times daily** (2400 mg/day) or **800 mg four times daily** (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nLet me know the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do intend 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give me a clinical reason. I'll put it in the order note so pharmacy can see it when they review."
      }
     ],
